    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff9ebeb1a23eb00d862a41ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天我在便当里放的是爸爸喜欢的料理，\n希望也能合训练员的胃口……",
      "source_fingerprint": "98bfec49a0c03951db21eb7a207bc85ef335ebb704b0f4e4c9b996abebf30f08",
