    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d0acce8bc62c55664f7d42",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，我今天跟朋友有约，差不多该出发了。\n那我先走啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "533ce346c8e5aebcf9b565306360d86335e81dc4278b91c6e935f4ddcf7c4ece",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
