    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d80112772613ab9a7af5b30",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这样的话，至少也该给她材料费……我在心中这么决定，\n并在训练员室继续吃着便当，这时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "00c12e68003ae6be60adafaa4689f93a6a889ccc9245dcabf832b9cfe3aea1a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1051/storytimeline_041051005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
