    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c5e4a38cfea57b466c1e2ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是以前很照顾我的前辈训练员传来的消息。\n虽然吃了便当后肚子已经有点饱──但也不好意思拒绝对方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89009cbcc2b285852fd4946d74f68711da435c77185555f0e0c3436ca30c23c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
